Fix various bits in activity usage.

Main fixes
 * do not remove activities when archiving records. Use case: archived
   employee with activities to do after their archive;
 * fix counter of record-free activities;
 * remove activities at unlink of every record, even not inheriting
   from mail.thread or mail.activity.mixin;
 * improve scheduling view;
 * synchronize activity and meeting dates;

See sub commits for more details.

Task-4848567: [activity] Activity on lost opportunity/lead not visible
Task-4813092: [calendar] Synchronize activity date with meeting
Task-4881877: [mail] Avoid orphan activities after record unlink
Task-4822292: [mail] Activity type visibility

